{"evidence":[{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Fallujah is an American technical death metal band from San Francisco, California, founded in 2007.","title":"Fallujah (band)"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" Fallujah has toured with acts such as The Black Dahlia Murder, Carnifex, Thy Art is Murder, Dying Fetus, Between the Buried and Me, and The Contortionist.","title":"Fallujah (band)"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Umbilical cord prolapse occurs when the umbilical cord comes out of the uterus with or before the presenting part of the fetus.","title":"Umbilical cord prolapse"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" It is a relatively rare condition and occurs in fewer than 1% of pregnancies.","title":"Umbilical cord prolapse"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" Cord prolapse is more common in women who have had rupture of their amniotic sac.","title":"Umbilical cord prolapse"},{"sentence_id":3,"text":" Other risk factors include maternal or fetal factors that prevent the fetus from occupying a normal position in the maternal pelvis, such as abnormal fetal lie, too much amniotic fluid, or a premature or small fetus.","title":"Umbilical cord prolapse"},{"sentence_id":4,"text":" The concern with cord prolapse is that pressure on the cord from the fetus will cause cord compression that compromises blood flow to the fetus.","title":"Umbilical cord prolapse"},{"sentence_id":5,"text":" Whenever there is a sudden decrease in fetal heart rate or abnormal fetal heart tracing, umbilical cord prolapse should be considered.","title":"Umbilical cord prolapse"},{"sentence_id":6,"text":" Due to the possibility for fetal death and other complications, umbilical cord prolapse is considered an obstetric emergency during pregnancy or labor.","title":"Umbilical cord prolapse"},{"sentence_id":7,"text":" Current management guidelines focus on quick delivery, which usually entails a cesarean section.","title":"Umbilical cord prolapse"},{"sentence_id":8,"text":" With appropriate management, the majority of cases have good neonatal outcomes.","title":"Umbilical cord prolapse"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Dying Fetus are an American death metal band originally from Upper Marlboro, Maryland.","title":"Dying Fetus"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" Formed in 1991, the group is known for their consistently hook-laden song structures, characterized by blast beats, complex riffing, slam riffs and heavy breakdowns. Additionally, their reality-based lyrics characterized by political/modern themes are notable in death metal.","title":"Dying Fetus"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" Various line-up changes throughout the years have left John Gallagher the remaining original member, as well as the band's driving force.","title":"Dying Fetus"},{"sentence_id":3,"text":" According to Gallagher, the band name was chosen while the members were of adolescent ages and was intended to be offensive.","title":"Dying Fetus"},{"sentence_id":4,"text":" To date, Dying Fetus has released eight studio albums.","title":"Dying Fetus"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Weltmacht (German for "World Power") was an American black metal band formed in DeKalb, Illinois in 1998.","title":"Weltmacht"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" Members of the band all went by pseudonyms: "Lord Imperial" (Neill Jameson), "Akhenaten" (Andrew Harris) and "Cryptic Winter" (Duane Timlin).","title":"Weltmacht"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" During this period, they also performed and/or recorded with Krieg (Lord Imperial's main outfit).","title":"Weltmacht"},{"sentence_id":3,"text":" Lyrical themes reveal a fascination with nihilism and war, rather than more common black metal themes such as Satanism, anti-Christian blasphemy and paganism.","title":"Weltmacht"},{"sentence_id":4,"text":" After the demise of Weltmacht in 2002, Lord Imperial went on to form N.I.L. and Duane Timlin eventually joined Dying Fetus.","title":"Weltmacht"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Destroy the Opposition is the third album by the Maryland, USA, death metal band Dying Fetus.","title":"Destroy the Opposition"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" It was produced by the band and Steve Carr.","title":"Destroy the Opposition"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" This album marks a change in Dying Fetus's direction, with political themes becoming dominant, which has continued in all of their subsequent albums.","title":"Destroy the Opposition"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Paul Cézanne ( or ; ] ; 19 January 1839 – 22 October 1906) was a French artist and Post-Impressionist painter whose work laid the foundations of the transition from the 19th-century conception of artistic endeavor to a new and radically different world of art in the 20th century.","title":"Paul Cézanne"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" Cézanne's often repetitive, exploratory brushstrokes are highly characteristic and clearly recognizable.","title":"Paul Cézanne"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" He used planes of colour and small brushstrokes that build up to form complex fields.","title":"Paul Cézanne"},{"sentence_id":3,"text":" The paintings convey Cézanne's intense study of his subjects.","title":"Paul Cézanne"}],"peer_messages":["Unverified peer answer: Both are American death metal bands.
