{"evidence":[{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Lotion Play is a subset of the better known Wet-And-Messy fetish (WAM), which typically involves participants using food (such as pudding or whipped cream), mud, or paint as a lubricant to facilitate sexual activity.","title":"Lotion play"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" Lotion Play isolates lotion specifically as a lubricating medium - setting it apart in the Wet-and-Messy genre, as other common WAM mediums do not have such specific popularity as Lotion Play.","title":"Lotion play"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" Lotion Play (ローションプレイ , rōshon purei ) , also known as gookkake, gluekkake, is a popular fetish, form of Japanese erotica and prostitution request involving the use of copious amounts of lubricant, which in the Japanese language is referred to by the Old-French word "lotion" (ローション in Japanese).","title":"Lotion play"},{"sentence_id":3,"text":"Typically lotion play involves a participant rubbing lotion on another using their body, sexual intercourse in a pool or bath filled with lotion, or lotion being poured over the participants during sex.","title":"Lotion play"},{"sentence_id":4,"text":" In Japan (and other parts of the world), lotion is available in concentrated form (e.g.: liter/gallon) which can be added to hot water to produce the desired amount of lotion.","title":"Lotion play"},{"sentence_id":5,"text":" A 1-gallon concentrate will typically yield 6-10 gallons of lotion (J-Lube Lotion Concentrate).","title":"Lotion play"},{"sentence_id":6,"text":" The main component in most lotion is polyacrylate.","title":"Lotion play"},{"sentence_id":7,"text":" A similar effect can be achieved by dissolving powdered methyl cellulose in water.","title":"Lotion play"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Yameen is a hiphop producer from Philadelphia, PA.","title":"Yameen"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" His most recent work, "Come On & Go Off" was released on September 2nd, 2014 on Rumble Pack Records.","title":"Yameen"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" His music can be heard weekly on the Activision videogames podcast, One of Swords where he is also occasionally a guest commentator.","title":"Yameen"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"The sural nerve is a sensory nerve in the calf region (sura) of the leg.","title":"Sural nerve"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" It is made up of collateral branches of the tibial nerve and common fibular nerve.","title":"Sural nerve"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" Two cutaneous branches, the medial and lateral, form the sural nerve.","title":"Sural nerve"},{"sentence_id":3,"text":" The medial cutaneous branch arises from the tibial nerve, and the lateral cutaneous branch arises from the common fibular nerve.","title":"Sural nerve"},{"sentence_id":4,"text":" The tibial nerve and the common fibular nerve arise as the sciatic nerve divides into two branches in the popliteal fossa.","title":"Sural nerve"},{"sentence_id":5,"text":" As the tibial nerve travels down the popliteal fossa, and before it goes beneath the gastrocnemius, it gives off a cutaneous branch which is the medial sural cutaneous nerve.","title":"Sural nerve"},{"sentence_id":6,"text":" This nerve courses laterally over the lateral head of the gastrocnemius.","title":"Sural nerve"},{"sentence_id":7,"text":" The common fibular nerve also gives off a small cutaneous branch which is the lateral sural cutaneous nerve.","title":"Sural nerve"},{"sentence_id":8,"text":" When the common fibular nerve is divided from the sciatic nerve, it travels parallel to the distal portion of the biceps femoris muscle and towards the fibular head.","title":"Sural nerve"},{"sentence_id":9,"text":" The small cutaneous branch arises as the common fibular nerve travels towards the fibular head.","title":"Sural nerve"},{"sentence_id":10,"text":" The nerve then continues down the leg on the posterior-lateral side, then posterior to the lateral malleolus where it runs deep to the fibularis tendon sheath and reaches the lateral tuberosity of the fifth toe, where it ramifies."